Error [jet.NondeterminismInPureEval]: `random.normal` is non-deterministic and cannot appear in a pure evaluation.
  --> tests/ui/comptime_nondeterministic.jet:8:23
    |
  8 |     draw: #run random.normal(0.0, 1.0)
    |                       ^^^^^^
 Why: Pure evaluation must produce the same result on every machine.
 Fix: Remove this call, or keep it at runtime outside the `#run` value.
 Denial: pure
 Call chain: random.normal
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3403

